      source: { title: "Dhammacakkappavattana Sutta (Setting in Motion the Wheel of the Dhamma)", author: "Traditional Buddhist scripture, the Buddha's first sermon", read: "The whole sermon, which is short: the Middle Way, the Four Noble Truths and the Eightfold Path." },
